  "body": "<!--\r\n  Thanks for submitting a pull request!\r\n  Please provide enough information so that others can review your pull request.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR adds test cases for all the related stacked PRs.\r\n\r\n- [x] test if `insights` middleware correct sets up userToken.\r\n- [x] test if `insights` middleware send event via insightsClient.\r\n- [x] test if `insights` middleware calls `onEvent` when it's given.\r\n- [x] test if `sendEvent` correctly called when widgets refine.\r\n- [x] test if `sendEvent` exposed to components works fine.\r\n- [x] test if `createSendEvent***` helpers work fine.\r\n- [x] test if `bindEvent` exposed to Hits and InfiniteHits works fine with its listener.\r\n\r\n**Stacked PRs**\r\n1. [introduce `insights` middleware](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4446)\r\n2. [send events from hits and refinementList](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4456)\r\n3. [implement sendEvent in all the connectors](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4463)\r\n4. [add tests](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4464) ← current\r\n\r\n## Next Steps\r\n\r\n**1. Update the documentation**\r\n\r\n**2. When this feature is released and become stable in the future, we need to deprecate**\r\n\r\n- `insightsClient` property in instantSearchInstance\r\n- public usage of `getInsightsAnonymousUserToken()` (now the middleware uses it internally)\r\n- the old way of attaching events on hits\r\n\r\n```js\r\n           <button ${instantsearch.insights('clickedObjectIDsAfterSearch', {\r\n             eventName: 'click-result',\r\n             objectIDs: [hit.objectID],\r\n           })}>\r\n             Click event\r\n           </button>\r\n           <button ${instantsearch.insights('convertedObjectIDsAfterSearch', {\r\n             eventName: 'click-result',\r\n             objectIDs: [hit.objectID],\r\n           })}>\r\n             Conversion event\r\n           </button>\r\n```\r\n\r\nand all the helpers and listeners around that function.",
  "changed_files": 29,
